WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.390
<b>High School Athletic Field</b>

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.750
Great job, Setoguchi-senpai!

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.110
Thanks.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.870
With that time, you're sure to 
make it through the prelims.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.870
Your turn next, Hiyori-chan!

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.050
Right!

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:40.130
<i>It's okay. This is the 
first step toward my dream.</i>

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.270
Get set!

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:07.460
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:11.960
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:16.340
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:20.300
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:24.500
<b>Heroines Run the Show</b>

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:31.940
<i>I need more love, want to see you again soon</i>

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:36.030
<i>Lock eyes with you and tell you</i>

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:39.950
<i>My sincerest "Thank you for everything"</i>

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:44.200
<i>Will you love me—not 
as a fan, but for real?</i>

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.250
<i>"Pick me"</i>

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.960
<i>"No, pick me"</i>

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:55.840
<i>Choose which kiss you want</i>

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.030
<i>And let your Romeo bind you</i>

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:03.470
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:08.020
<i>I'm charmed watching you sing with me</i>

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:11.340
<i>I'm even charmed by your tears</i>

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:15.740
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:19.360
<i>Thank you for coming to meet me</i>

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:23.660
<i>Thank you for calling my name</i>

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:28.210
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:32.400
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:38.720
We got samples of the concert goods!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.220
Really? Let's see them!

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.490
They all look great.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:45.090
This is awesome!

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:46.880
The towel seems good enough to use.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.300
Hey, didn't the light-up rings come?

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.560
Yes, sorry, they're here.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.530
Here we go.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.770
Oh, they look nice!

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:05.160
Not bad.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.900
The twinkling is pretty.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.160
Yeah.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:17.760
Refreshing
<b>Orange</b>

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.340
Okay.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:23.340
<b>Dad</b>

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.000
Huh? Uh...

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.770
H-Hello?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.020
<i>Hiyori! It's yer dad.</i>

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:33.050
You're really not comin' 
home for summer break?

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:35.400
I'll miss ya so much!

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:41.030
You sound back to full strength, Dad.
 I heard yer back is better!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.270
I'm good as new! Back to fishin', too.

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.360
Fishin'!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.630
Swing me too, Dad!

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:48.910
Me, too!

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.670
Now, dear. That's not why we called.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:52.290
Right.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.170
Hiyori, did ya get yer allowance okay?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.060
Yep! Thanks.

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:02.120
<i>Oh, good. So, how was nationals?</i>

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:04.100
<i>You had a competition, right?</i>

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:08.180
Yeah... about that...

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.540
I lost in the prelims.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.050
Oh...

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.940
Shh!

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.940
I can just try again next time.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:22.300
Very true.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:23.090
<i>Yep!</i>

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:27.200
But Hiyori, don't push yerself too hard.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:32.020
<i>You've always tended to overwork yerself.</i>

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:34.330
<i>Remember that meet in middle school?</i>

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.070
I'm fine!

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:39.010
I made some friends, and I'm havin' fun.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:00.980
<i>"Julieta" Concert Tour
<b></b></i>New Date Added

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:00.140
So you didn't qualify for nationals...

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.490
No, I hurt my foot.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.280
Your foot? When?

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:11.120
Well, um... a little while ago.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.120
But I'm fine now.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.350
Really?

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:18.380
I can't stay gloomy about it forever. Plus...

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:23.630
<i>"Julieta" Concert Tour
<b></b></i>New Date Added

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:21.040
The concert's in two days.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:23.630
I'll work my hardest!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.060
I'm glad to hear that, but...

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:31.460
Your contract ends after that concert.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.260
Would you be willing to stay on?

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:41.020
I came to Tokyo to run.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.300
Yes, of course.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.660
Well, I'll count on you for two more days.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:49.720
Yes!

00:05:57.660 --> 00:05:59.810
Do that part one more time!

00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:01.270
Yes, sir!

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:21.480
Hey.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.220
Hey.

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:25.940
Hey!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.030
Towels.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.540
R-Right!

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.620
Here, your towel.

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.620
For you, Aizo.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:42.870
I see. If I open this up, 
it absorbs all my sweat!

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.250
<i>Not</i>!

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:49.010
Don't look at me like that! 
<i>You</i> gave this to me!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.060
She made the slip-up.

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:52.570
S-Sorry.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.030
Sheesh...

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.690
Here's your towel.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.890
Is there something up with you?

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.900
Hmm? Me?

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:06.110
You usually dash around so much 
it's annoying, but lately you're slow.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:11.410
Y-Ya think so? I've been dashin', really!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.110
Uh-huh...

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:19.660
Right...

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.660
Fine. Iced coffee! Colder than the North Pole.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:23.410
Huh?

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.190
Cocoa with milk. Chilled, but no ice.

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:27.300
Say what?

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.180
Dash.

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.260
You have three seconds.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.000
H-Huh?!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.610
Okay, go.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.140
She's hiding something.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.980
Hi, you two. I brought you food.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.400
Oh, where's Hiyori-chan?

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.770
No clue.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.940
Probably slacking off.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:53.560
Slacking? I highly doubt that.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.800
You know her manager-in-training 
job is over after the concert.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:03.170
She told me she'd give it her all until then.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:06.920
And that next season she'll make nationals.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.210
<i>Next</i> season?

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:12.220
You know her dream, right?

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:18.100
Apparently she lost in the prelims 
because of an injured foot.

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.470
Her foot?

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:26.390
Was it that day?

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:29.160
Was that when...

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.620
Argh, that idiot!

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:47.080
Talk about poor life choices.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.090
Romeo

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.090
Repaint

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.410
Hey.

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:02.350
Can we change the set list?

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.390
Hey!

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.280
We're running the "Nonfantasy" 
encore one more time.

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:14.650
Excuse me.

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.280
We'd like to ask you something.

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:26.200
The line for merchandise is to my right!

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:40.340
<i>This is my last day as manager-in-training.</i>

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.410
Time to work hard!

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.350
LIP×LIP is here!

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.300
Good morning.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.250
Thank you for your support today.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.360
The green room is over here!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.600
Here, fresh washcloths.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.280
I'll be right back with your drinks.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.300
Hey.

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:05.290
Yes?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.710
This is your last day, right?

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.330
Y-Yeah...

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.170
Don't space out and mess anything up.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.800
Not to worry! I'm rarin' to go!

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.540
Being <i>too</i> enthusiastic will 
make you slip up, too.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:20.550
I told you, not to worry!

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:24.000
I want iced and hot today.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.560
Ditto for me.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.090
I'm on it!

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.700
Okay.

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.490
<i>They look serious.</i>

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.410
What?

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:57.170
Not to worry! I know you two 
will put on a great concert!

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.570
Obviously.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.050
We don't want a pep talk from you.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.390
Right, sorry.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:04.510
Stand by, please.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:05.720
Right!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:16.580
<i>I guess I won't have any more 
conversations like that.</i>

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.530
<i>I'm gettin' nervous for them!</i>

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.410
You'll go right on time.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:23.580
Right.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.040
Suzumi.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:31.800
Get all your work done before the encore.

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:32.570
Huh?!

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.170
O-Okay...

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.350
Well, shall we?

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.470
Just don't slow me down.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.530
"Romeo."

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:11.320
<i>Pleased to meet you, fair lady, 
I've come from a western land</i>

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:14.620
<i>To meet you, to love you, 
and to win your hand</i>

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:18.170
<i>Don't be alarmed, I know this is sudden</i>

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.720
<i>Please be my princess, 
and let me be your husband</i>

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:33.230
<i>Let's cherish the today that only comes once</i>

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:35.450
<i>Reset yesterday</i>

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:38.480
<i>We'll repaint the spring—</i>

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.900
<i>Order in the court!</i>

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.910
<i>Let's leave it to the judge and pray</i>

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.060
<i>Let's stroll the night sky</i>

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:54.330
<i>I'll escort you, tell you 
all about our blue planet</i>

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:50.830
<b>From Chutan</b>

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:59.960
<i>I'll give you half of me 
in hopes of half of you</i>

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:05.200
<i>They'll mix together till we 
can't do without each other</i>

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:10.470
<i>No love in the world is stronger than mine</i>

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:15.530
<i>We may fight sometimes, 
but that's part of love</i>

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:18.100
<i>Give me half of you</i>

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.070
Thank you for coming!

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:38.050
Let's meet again!

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:47.630
Phew. Only the encore left.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.720
Oh, there you are.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:52.140
Here.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.900
What's this?

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:58.770
Your ticket. The boys got you a seat.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.030
What?

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.430
Go on, get out there.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:10.470
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:11.580
<i>Seat D-22... It's over there?!</i>

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:26.300
Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:16.690
<i>Second level front and center! 
This is a premium seat!</i>

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:33.700
Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:32.600
<i>I didn't know concert halls were so intense.</i>

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:37.520
Thank you!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.530
<i>Amazin'!</i>

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.710
Shh.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.350
Shh.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:58.910
We're only here today thanks to Julieta.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.540
Thank you!

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.090
A lot has happened.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.620
You charged forward at full speed.

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:13.870
You didn't want to limit yourself, 
so you gritted your teeth,

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.930
but you did stumble sometimes.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.630
Still, all the days of 
work you put in were real.

00:15:24.180 --> 00:15:27.940
Everything in your past 
will help push you forward.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:33.900
For doing your best, 
we dedicate this last song to you.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.870
"Dream Fanfare"!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.420
<i>I thought the encore was "Nonfantasy"...</i>

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:56.880
<i>The whole neighborhood is one color</i>

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:03.270
<i>Different colors just got pointed at</i>

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:07.090
<i>So they hid away, afraid</i>

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:13.930
<i>And started becoming that same color</i>

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:16.580
<i>Tomorrow</i>

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:15.620
<i>Why is it?</i>

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:16.950
<i>Don't run from what you love</i>

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.560
<i>Hold your head high and shine</i>

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:23.690
<i>I've heard this song so many times, 
but it sounds different now.</i>

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:24.130
<i>It's a big world! Look and see</i>

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.420
<i>We</i>

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.970
<i>Learn to be selfish</i>

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.760
<i>Stick with our dreams, not our peers</i>

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:34.600
<i>That negative self? Leave it behind</i>

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:33.070
<i>The lyrics... The melody...</i>

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.470
<i>I feel them!</i>

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:40.900
<i>Your hue is beautiful and one of a kind</i>

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:45.950
<i>Like a flower giving the world color</i>

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:53.110
<i>Come on, lift your head, no need to be shy</i>

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.250
<i>Stay your special self</i>

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:00.380
<i>Isn't it a waste to wait for your fun? Go get it</i>

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.700
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:07.070
<i>Take your own first step! Enjoy your dream</i>

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:22.030
<i>Tomorrow</i>

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.560
<i>If you drop dead</i>

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.250
<i>Will you have lived a life</i>

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:29.840
<i>You don't regret? Ask your heart</i>

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:32.570
<i>We</i>

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.570
<i>Live to do what we enjoy</i>

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.440
<i>Live for the day we trade smiles</i>

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:40.770
<i>That's why we live! Don't forget</i>

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:42.050
<i>Hit the mark!</i>

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:47.990
<i>Your hue is beautiful and one of a kind</i>

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.150
<i>Amazin'... Amazin'...</i>

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:48.210
<i>They're amazin'!</i>

00:17:47.990 --> 00:17:53.070
<i>Like a flower giving the world color</i>

00:17:53.070 --> 00:18:00.020
<i>Come on, lift your head, no need to be shy</i>

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:03.240
<i>Stay your special self</i>

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:08.260
<i>Isn't it a waste not to do 
what you want? Athlete's oath</i>

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.620
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:13.310
<i>Another person's dream 
won't do! Enjoy yourself</i>

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:18.510
<i>For doing your best, we dedicate 
this dream fanfare to you</i>

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.560
We crushed it.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.720
Yeah.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.390
Great job today!

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:54.100
And...

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.290
I'm sorry!

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:59.310
For before, when I...

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:02.360
talked bad about idols.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.060
Oh...

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:09.960
Somehow I didn't get it, 
even though I saw ya workin' so hard.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:13.000
But I get it now.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:17.100
Idols are amazin', aren't they?!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:20.950
Of course!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.590
So you finally get it.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:26.850
Yeah! It was really, really, really amazin'!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:30.100
You sure sound pumped up.

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:33.230
Good work today. Oh, you're still in costume?

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.040
I forgot.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:34.630
Yeah.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:39.740
Once you get changed, we need 
to greet the staff. Get ready.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:43.990
Then we'll have a celebratory dinner. 
It'll be Hiyoko's send-off, too.

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:49.250
Um!

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:52.430
Um...

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:53.780
What is it?

00:19:55.710 --> 00:20:00.600
I don't really know what 
I'm worth yet, but...

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.010
I want to be useful to them.

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.250
I want to support them!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.270
So...

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.930
Please let me continue 
as manager-in-training!

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:18.020
Please!

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:21.690
What about track?

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:26.590
Your dream is to run at nationals, right?

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:28.900
Work on your own dream.

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:32.540
Why do you think we sang "Dream Fanfare"?

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:42.260
I wanna give my all to track 
and this manager job both!

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:45.050
Is that okay?

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.720
How about it, you two?

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:55.180
Well, I don't want to deal 
with another new person.

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:57.230
Let her try, I guess.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:01.090
Then we'll be updating her contract.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:02.240
Yes!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:05.930
Thank you very much! I'll work hard!

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:10.490
I'm happy to keep working together.

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:17.470
I'll go change now.

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:18.500
Me, too.

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:23.510
W-Wait!

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:26.170
What?

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:28.780
Why?!

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:37.450
<b>Nagisa</b>

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:38.140
<i>Leave a message after the beep.</i>

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:43.000
How's it goin', Hiyori? This is Nagisa.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.490
Wait for me, Hiyori!

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.460
I'm on my way there.

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:55.000
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:55.000
<b>Idols Are Amazin'!</b>

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:32.940
Next time, on episode 6 of 
<i>Heroines Run the Show</i>...

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:35.010
"Producing Hiyori."

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Episode 6
Producing Hiyori.</b>
